POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC01",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "SJO",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "A1",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-07-02T08:00:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-07-02T12:30:00"
}


### 21. Crear vuelo con llegada antes de salida
# Esperado: 400 Bad Request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC01",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "MIA",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "A1",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-07-02T12:30:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-07-02T08:00:00"
}


### 22. Crear vuelo valido para pruebas de conflicto
# Esperado: 201 Created.
# Este vuelo reserva el avion TI-TEC01 y la puerta Z1 en SJO a las 08:00.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC01",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "MIA",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "Z1",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-07-10T08:00:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-07-10T12:00:00"
}


### 23. Crear vuelo con el mismo avion y horario traslapado
# Esperado: 409 Conflict.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC01",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "MIA",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "Z2",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-07-10T10:00:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-07-10T13:00:00"
}


### 24. Crear vuelo con misma puerta y misma hora de salida
# Esperado: 409 Conflict.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC02",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "MIA",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "z1",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-07-10T08:00:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-07-10T11:00:00"
}


### 25. Crear vuelo con el mismo avion pero sin traslape
# Esperado: 201 Created.
# La salida coincide con la llegada del vuelo 11, por lo que los rangos no se traslapan.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC01",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "MIA",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "Z2",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-07-10T12:00:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-07-10T15:00:00"
}


### 26. Crear vuelo con misma puerta pero diferente hora de salida
# Esperado: 201 Created.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC02",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "MIA",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "Z1",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-07-10T10:00:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-07-10T11:30:00"
}


### 27. Actualizar vuelo con datos validos
# Esperado: 200 OK.
# flightId viene de la ruta y no se permite editarlo desde el body.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC03",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "LIR",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "A8",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-06-11T07:30:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-06-11T08:15:00"
}


