### 32. Actualizar vuelo causando traslape de avion
# Vuelo 1 usa TI-TEC01 de 08:00 a 09:20 el 2026-06-10.
# Esperado: 409 Conflict.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC01",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "LIR",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "A8",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-06-10T08:30:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-06-10T10:00:00"
}


### 33. Actualizar vuelo causando conflicto de puerta
# Vuelo 1 usa la puerta A1 en SJO a las 08:00.
# Esperado: 409 Conflict.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "planePlate": "TI-TEC03",
  "airportDepartsFromId": "SJO",
  "airportArrivesToId": "LIR",
  "state": "OPEN",
  "gate": "A1",
  "departureDatetime": "2026-06-10T08:00:00",
  "arrivalDatetime": "2026-06-10T09:00:00"
